			"notes": "## StreamerMode++ v1.1.0  \nAdds more F3 hiding options and cleans up the codebase.\n\nThis update adds support for hiding:\n\n- Targeted block info  \n- Targeted fluid info  \n\nYou can now also customize the message shown when these are hidden, just like the other lines.\n\nThe default menu keybind is `-` (minus key), but you can change it in the Controls settings.\n\nGreat for anarchy servers or just keeping your spot secret."
		},
