			"notes": "## StreamerMode++ v1.0.0\n\nFirst release of StreamerMode++!\n\nThis mod lets you hide parts of the F3 screen to keep your base or location private while streaming.  \nYou can hide:\n- Coordinates  \n- Block info  \n- Chunk info  \n- Facing direction  \n\nYou can also customize the message that replaces each hidden line.\n\nThe default menu keybind is `-` (minus key), but you can change it in the Controls settings.\n\nGreat for anarchy servers or just keeping your spot secret."
